control: A stored grant stamped later than the request that sees it counts for one second from that request and then leaves the window
removes: a stored grant keeps its stamp however far ahead it lies, so it fills the window until the clock reaches it
packages: ./ratelimit/core
tests: TestIssue TestAFutureStampCountsForOneSecondFromTheRequestThatSeesIt
scheduled-count: no

